column3:
`atualizar_media_de_publico(league)` (cdecl, game.cpp, unnamed in the map): updates the clubs' average attendance at the end of each league season. Called by the seasons loop (0x5d5ae0, at 0x5d5cfb: push league; call; add esp, 4), at the end of the season of each league of the nation (the top one and those below, through +0x20). 
 The club's average attendance (+0x73, Attendance) moves with the season result, between the minimum (+0x77) and the record (+0x7b). The weight `f` comes from the competition's nation (the first dword of [+4]+0x5d): 0.1 in [0x9cf510], [0x9cf2dc], [0x9cf3e4], [0x9cf224]; 0.25 in [0x9cf2c0], [0x9cf2fc], [0x9cf408], [0x9cf4a8], [0x9cf4f8]; 0.5 in [0x9cf45c]; 1 in the others. `r` = the competition's reputation (+0x69 of the record, word). The final table comes from the statistics (Comp_Stats::get_sorted_team_table 0x4a4b20, thiscall(+8, 1, &n, 1000), ret 0xc: 0x76-byte records, +0 the club id, +0x72 the predicted position, +0x73 the final one, +5 the home games [inference], +6 the summed attendance [inference]). 
 For each club (the branches in the original's order, with the same calls to virtuals +0x98 "has promotion" and +0x9c "has relegation"; d = predicted − final + 1, word): 
 - champion without promotion: + (r + max(d, 0)) × 200 × f (stadium owner, +0x6d) or × 100 × f; 
 - 2nd (or position 0) without promotion: + (r + max(d, 0)) × 125 × f or × 65 × f; 
 - promoted (position ≤ +0xbe): by the league above ([0xadadfc][+0x1c]; without it, nothing): v = the club's +0x80 (reputation, word) × max(r above − r, 1) × f × 0.1, at least 100; + v + draw(v) (owner) or + v; and the floor by the reputation of the league above; 
 - promotion play-off (+0xbf ≠ 0 and position ≤ +0xbf): with d − 1 > 0: + draw(r(d − 1) × 75 × f) + r(d − 1) × 75 × f (owner) or + draw(r(d − 1) × 25 × f) + r(d − 1) × 10 × f; otherwise + draw(r × 50 × f or r × 25 × f); with home games, the mix with the real attendance: (summed attendance / games + 4 × average) × f × 0.2; 
 - relegated (position > +0x3e − +0xc1): by the league below (without it, nothing): v = +0x80 × min(r below − r, −1) × f × 0.2, at most −100 (with no relegation in the league below, +0x20 = −1: v = 2v − 250 − draw(750)); + v + draw(v); and the ceiling of 2000 (r below ≤ 7) or 3000 times r below, × f; 
 - the others: + draw(r × d × 5 × f), × 10 for the owner with d > 0 or with +0x80 above 500 × r; the mix with the real attendance (without the weight f); the floor by reputation; and the ceiling of 2000 r (r ≤ 7), 3000 r (r ≤ 12) or 5000 r. 
 At the end of each: at least 500, and within [+0x77, +0x7b]. The table is freed (free 0x9452ca).
